node0 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>inspection</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/inspection' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/inspection</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;A thorough examination or checking of documentation, records, processes, or systems to confirm compliance or adherence. An inspection needs to have a defined set of acceptance criteria (e.g. a checklist), a documentation of roles involved in the inspection (e.g. to document the inspector&#x27;s independence) and a clear documentation of when and how it was performed.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
